en : Grants a corrosive damage over time that can also damage buildings. Level 2 Red : Grants splash damage to the dragon's attacks. Level 3 Blue : Grants a debuff immunity piercing movement and attack frost slow on attack.", "scepter_loc": "Increases the current level of Dragon Form by one. Adds a Level 4 Black Dragon that has free pathing, bonus magic resistance, and increased other bonuses."}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "6e6a64d618f4d36a4609", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:dragon_knight_elder_dragon_form:attack_modifier:base", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:dragon_knight_elder_dragon_form:attack_slow:base", "mechanism": "attack_slow", "mechanism_zh": "减攻速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的攻击速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "cb5bb3a2643bdd4bf2b7", "mechanism": "cleave", "mechanism_zh": "分裂溅射", "definition": "攻击伤害波及周围单位", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "be712c59471918e24e3c", "mechanism": "debuff_immunity", "mechanism_zh": "减益免疫/技能免疫", "definition": "处于减益免疫（技能免疫）时，只有能无视减益免疫的效果才对其生效（如碎颅锤的重击可以眩晕开了黑皇杖的单位）", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "89bb7abdaa5801717a6b", "mechanism": "haste", "mechanism_zh": "加速", "definition": "提升自身、自己的单位或友方的移动速度（顺带加一点移速的也算）；只让敌人变慢的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:dragon_knight_elder_dragon_form:pierces_debuff_immunity:base", "mechanism": "pierces_debuff_immunity", "mechanism_zh": "无视减益免疫", "definition": "效果对处于减益免疫的敌方仍生效（技能看immunity=3，装备看官方说明）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "e6c313e5e1fb7a71811b", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:dragon_knight_elder_dragon_form:terrain_walk:scepter", "mechanism": "terrain_walk", "mechanism_zh": "无视地形", "definition": "移动时不受悬崖等不可通行地形阻挡，也能穿过树木", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "dragon_knight_wyrms_wrath", "name_zh": "龙骑士·飞龙之怒", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "The life blood of the Dragon improves Dragon Knight's abilities and items to have increased AoE and causes his attacks to deal additional magic damage to enemy units."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "The life blood of the Dragon improves Dragon Knight's abilities and items to have increased AoE and causes his attacks to deal additional magic damage to enemy units."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "bonus_aoe", "old": {"base": [30, 60, 90, 120], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [40, 60, 80, 100], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "3a142489218dfc0c5358", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "audit:dragon_knight_wyrms_wrath:attack_modifier:base", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "3e8f1af570bf9be7696d", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "2d41eccbb5b247802970", "mechanism": "magic_resist_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减魔抗/魔法易伤", "definition": "降低目标魔抗，或让目标受到更多魔法或技能伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "drow_ranger_frost_arrows", "name_zh": "卓尔游侠·霜冻之箭", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Adds a freezing effect to Drow's attacks, slowing enemy movement and dealing bonus damage. Slow lasts %abilityduration% seconds.",