分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:drow_ranger_frost_arrows:attack_modifier:scepter", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "6be4e658b103b050ae67", "mechanism": "heal_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "治疗削减", "definition": "降低或禁止目标的任何形式生命恢复，含属性回复；提升生命上限的效果不受影响", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "364196fb532d1d8ea50f", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "99f1f8721d7cb7a33a43", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "bee5da1b1ff84d191931", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "drow_ranger_marksmanship", "name_zh": "卓尔游侠·射手天赋", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Drow's experiences in battle grant her a chance to launch arrows with incredible accuracy and effectiveness. Pierces through the enemy's defenses, ignoring their base armor. This ability is disabled if there is an enemy hero within %disable_range% range.", "notes_loc": ["Marksmanship procs have true strike."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Drow's experiences in battle grant her a chance to launch arrows with incredible accuracy and effectiveness. Pierces through the enemy's defenses, ignoring their base armor. This ability is disabled if there is an enemy hero within %disable_range% range.", "notes_loc": ["Marksmanship procs have true strike."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "bonus_damage", "old": {"base": [50, 70, 90], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [60, 75, 90], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:drow_ranger_marksmanship:attack_modifier:base", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "2511252c86193016cc7f", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "655e436cc731512cf2f5", "mechanism": "economy", "mechanism_zh": "经济经验", "definition": "提供额外金钱或经验；只是正常赏金不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "b66bc1ee209d0ed5431b", "mechanism": "pierce_evasion", "mechanism_zh": "克敌机先", "definition": "攻击无视闪避（必中）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "drow_ranger_wave_of_silence", "name_zh": "卓尔游侠·狂风", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Releases a wave that silences and knocks back and reveals invisible enemy units. Knockback distance is relative to how close they are to Drow."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Releases a wave that silences and knocks back and reveals invisible enemy units. Knockback distance is relative to how close they are to Drow."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "cooldowns", "old": [19, 17, 15, 13], "new": [18, 16, 14, 12]}, {"field": "AbilityCooldown", "old": {"base": [19, 17, 15, 13], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [18, 16, 14, 12], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "43b337c5ee02e95f2e5c", "mechanism": "displace_other", "mechanism_zh": "位移他人", "definition": "拉、推、交换、投掷其他单位（如动人之舐、移形换位）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "09c1d4fa5717c67484ac", "mechanism": "invisibility", "mechanism_zh": "隐身", "definition": "使自身、队友、召唤物或复制体隐身", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "043a8932d0a3c333e6f8", "mechanism": "reveal", "mechanism_zh": "显形", "definition": "使隐身单位显形，不等于持续真视", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "bde5fca96c6e325f6001", "mechanism": "silence", "mechanism_zh": "沉默", "definition": "目标无法施放技能（仍可攻击、使用物品）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "74d194627da4b9ab6609", "mechanism": "true_sight", "mechanism_zh": "真视", "definition": "可看见隐身单位", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "earth_spirit_boulder_smash", "name_zh": "大地之灵·巨石冲击", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Earth Spirit smashes the target enemy or ally, sending them in the direction he is facing. If Earth Spirit targets an area, he will smash the nearest unit in a %remnant_smash_radius_tooltip% radius, prioritizing Stone Remnants. The travelling unit or Remnant damages all enemy units it hits. If an enemy is hit by a Stone Remnant, they are also slowed. Stone Remnants travel further than other units."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Earth Spirit smashes the target enemy or ally, sending them in the direction he is facing. If Earth Spirit targets an area, he will smash the nearest unit in a %remnant_smash_radius_tooltip% radius, prioritizing Stone Remnants. The travelling unit or Remnant damages all enemy units it hits. If an enemy is hit by a Stone Remnant, they are also slowed. Stone Remnants travel further than other units."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "move_slow", "old": {"base": [50], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [40], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "4247f048ada1fb46640f", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:earth_spirit_boulder_smash:displace_other:base", "mechanism": "displace_other", "mechanism_zh": "位移他人", "definition": "拉、推、交换、投掷其他单位（如动人之舐、移形换位）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "8603dd22ec8f2ad10087", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "1fe0945420ea91e4bcef", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "earth_spirit_geomagnetic_grip", "name_zh": "大地之灵·地磁之握", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Earth Spirit pulls the target Stone Remnant or Allied Unit. Enemies struck by the gripped target will be silenced. Pulled Remnants also deal damage to struck enemies. Cast range is reduced when targeting an ally.", "notes_loc": ["Will not work on a unit inside Chronosphere, Duel, or Black Hole.", "Geomagnetic Grip can also target allied creeps."], "shard_loc": "Decreases cooldown to %AbilityCooldown%s and increases allied unit cast range and pull speed."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Earth Spirit pulls the target Stone Remnant or Allied Unit. Enemies struck by the gripped target will be silenced. Pulled Remnants also deal damage to struck enemies. Cast range is reduced when targeting an ally.", "notes_loc": ["Will not work on a unit inside Chronosphere, Duel, or Black Hole.", "Geomagnetic Grip can also target allied creeps."], "shard_loc": "Decreases cooldown to %AbilityCooldown%s and increases allied unit cast range and pull speed."}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "0b7c301eed42f6a6e4a2", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "6c02d8a73b7b7821d9dd", "mechanism": "displace_other", "mechanism_zh": "位移他人", "definition": "拉、推、交换、投掷其他单位（如动人之舐、移形换位）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "0178dd52ce9cbd0700d9", "mechanism": "silence", "mechanism_zh": "沉默", "definition": "目标无法施放技能（仍可攻击、使用物品）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "earth_spirit_magnetize", "name_zh": "大地之灵·磁化", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Magnetizes units in a small nearby area, causing them to take damage for a short duration. Magnetized heroes cause nearby Stone Remnants to explode, destroying the remnant and refreshing Magnetize's duration on all nearby enemies. This process can repeat multiple times. If an enemy hero is affected by Geomagnetic Grip or Boulder Smash, all magnetized heroes share the effects.", "facets_loc": ["Magnetizing a Stone Remnant gives Earth Spirit bonus attack damage for %magnetized_rocks_buff_self_duration% seconds. Does not stack."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Magnetizes units in a small nearby area, causing them to take damage for a short duration. Magnetized heroes cause nearby Stone Remnants to explode, destroying the remnant and refreshing Magnetize's duration on all nearby enemies. This process can repeat multiple times. If an enemy hero is affected by Geomagnetic Grip or Boulder Smash, all magnetized heroes share the effects.", "facets_loc": ["Magnetizing a Stone Remnant gives Earth Spirit bonus attack damage for %magnetized_rocks_buff_self_duration% seconds. Does not stack."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "damage_per_second", "old": {"base": [45, 90, 135], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [40, 80, 120], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "10ec9c5154106e14895f", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "1c99543ccd74dd5c5a5f", "mechanism": "silence", "mechanism_zh": "沉默", "definition": "目标无法施放技能（仍可攻击、使用物品）", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "7f93a26752faa5b16afa", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "earth_spirit_rolling_boulder", "name_zh": "大地之灵·巨石翻滚", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Earth Spirit gathers himself into a boulder and, after a %delay%s delay, rolls toward the target location, dealing %damage% + %damage_str%%% STR damage and stunning enemy units. He will stop if he collides with an enemy hero or is stunned. If he rolls over a Stone Remnant, he will travel further and faster, and stun enemies for longer.", "notes_loc": ["Rolling over a Stone Remnant will destroy the Remnant.", "The boulder has a radius of %radius%.", "Earth Spirit is untargetable and invulnerable while rolling."], "facets_loc": ["Stone Remnants are not destroyed when rolled over, and the cooldown of Stone Remnant is refreshed when the roll is done.", "Rolling over an allied hero grants the allied hero and Earth Spirit %allied_bonus_movespeed%%% bonus movespeed for %allied_bonus_movespeed_duration%s. If he rolls over an allied hero, Earth Spirit will travel further and faster, and stun enemies for longer,"]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Earth Spirit gathers himself into a boulder and, after a %delay%s delay, rolls toward the target location, dealing %damage% + %damage_str%%% STR damage and stunning enemy units. He will stop if he collides with an enemy hero or is stunned. If he rolls over a Stone Remnant, he will travel further and faster, and stun enemies for longer.", "notes_loc": ["Rolling over a Stone Remnant will destroy the Remnant.", "The boulder has a radius of %radius%.", "Earth Spirit is untargetable and invulnerable while rolling."], "facets_loc": ["Stone Remnants are not destroyed when rolled over, and the cooldown of Stone Remnant is refreshed when the roll is done.", "Rolling over an allied hero grants the allied hero and Earth Spirit %allied_bonus_movespeed%%% bonus movespeed for %allied_bonus_movespeed_duration%s. If he rolls over an allied hero, Earth Spirit will travel further and faster, and stun enemies for longer,"]}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "8936f216ef34d2956070", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "1abdd5c435a577eb104b", "mechanism": "invulnerable_untargetable", "mechanism_zh": "无敌/不可选取", "definition": "暂时无法被伤害或无法被指向", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:earth_spirit_rolling_boulder:self_mobility:base", "mechanism": "self_mobility", "mechanism_zh": "自身位移", "definition": "闪烁、冲刺、跳跃、传送等主动改变自身位置", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "1fb8b55a1b0d41c02e6d", "mechanism": "stun", "mechanism_zh": "眩晕", "definition": "使目标无法行动和施法的硬控（含小眩晕）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:earth_spirit_rolling_boulder:terrain_walk:base", "mechanism": "terrain_walk", "mechanism_zh": "无视地形", "definition": "移动时不受悬崖等不可通行地形阻挡，也能穿过树木", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "earth_spirit_stone_caller", "name_zh": "大地之灵·残岩", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Call a Stone Remnant to the target location. Stone Remnants have no vision and are invulnerable, and can be used with Earth Spirit's abilities. Calling a Stone Remnant consumes a charge, which recharge over time. Stone Remnant has %AbilityCharges% charges. Earth Spirit passively gains %attack_damage_per_stone%%% bonus damage per unused Stone Remnant charge, and gains an additional %attack_damage_per_stone_used%%% bonus damage for %buff_duration%s when a Stone Remnant is targeted with an ability (does not stack).", "facets_loc": ["Has a fixed cooldown instead of charges."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Call a Stone Remnant to the target location. Stone Remnants have no vision and are invulnerable, and can be used with Earth Spirit's abilities. Calling a Stone Remnant consumes a charge, which recharge over time. Stone Remnant has %AbilityCharges% charges. Earth Spirit passively gains %attack_damage_per_stone%%% bonus damage per unused Stone Remnant charge, and gains an additional %attack_damage_per_stone_used%%% bonus damage for %buff_duration%s when a Stone Remnant is targeted with an ability (does not stack).", "notes_loc": ["Break disables the bonus damage."], "facets_loc": ["Has a fixed cooldown instead of charges."]}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "fcf44279ab944ef44d37", "mechanism": "charges", "mechanism_zh": "充能", "definition": "技能或物品用一次消耗一点；只决定数值或层数的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "e7296373113786c745d3", "mechanism": "invulnerable_untargetable", "mechanism_zh": "无敌/不可选取", "definition": "暂时无法被伤害或无法被指向", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "earthshaker_echo_slam", "name_zh": "撼地者·回音击", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Shockwaves travel through the ground, damaging enemy units. Each enemy hit causes an echo to damage nearby units. Real heroes cause two echoes."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Shockwaves travel through the ground, damaging enemy units. Each enemy hit causes an echo to damage nearby units. Real heroes cause two echoes."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "cooldowns", "old": [130, 120, 110], "new": [125, 115, 105]}, {"field": "AbilityCooldown", "old": {"base": [130, 120, 110], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [125, 115, 105], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "echo_slam_echo_damage", "old": {"base": [70, 90, 110], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [60, 80, 100], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "ef9051ea93f657552597", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "earthshaker_enchant_totem", "name_zh": "撼地者·强化图腾", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Empowers Earthshaker's totem, causing it to deal extra damage and have %bonus_attack_range% bonus attack range on the next attack.", "notes_loc": ["Bonus damage is based on base damage and that given by primary attribute."], "scepter_loc": "Enchant Totem becomes a ground target ability, causing Earthshaker to jump in the air and land at the target spot, casting Enchant Totem there. Self-casting the ability will behave in the original form, without jumping. Grants Enchant Totem a cleaving attack."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Empowers Earthshaker's totem, causing it to deal extra damage and have %bonus_attack_range% bonus attack range on the next attack.", "notes_loc": ["Bonus damage is based on base damage and that given by primary attribute."], "scepter_loc": "Enchant Totem becomes a ground target ability, causing Earthshaker to jump in the air and land at the target spot, casting Enchant Totem there. Self-casting the ability will behave in the original form, without jumping. Grants Enchant Totem a cleaving attack."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "scepter_cleave_pct", "old": {"base": [0], "scepter": [40], "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [0], "scepter": [50], "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:earthshaker_enchant_totem:aoe_damage:scepter", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "6d614cb713be19a24053", "mechanism": "cleave", "mechanism_zh": "分裂溅射", "definition": "攻击伤害波及周围单位", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:earthshaker_enchant_totem:self_mobility:scepter", "mechanism": "self_mobility", "mechanism_zh": "自身位移", "definition": "闪烁、冲刺、跳跃、传送等主动改变自身位置", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:earthshaker_enchant_totem:terrain_walk:scepter", "mechanism": "terrain_walk", "mechanism_zh": "无视地形", "definition": "移动时不受悬崖等不可通行地形阻挡，也能穿过树木", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "elder_titan_ancestral_spirit", "name_zh": "上古巨神·灵体游魂", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Elder Titan sends forth his Astral Spirit, damaging any units it passes through. When the spirit rejoins the Titan, it grants bonus damage and movement speed for each unit it passed through. The Astral Spirit possesses the Echo Stomp, Return Spirit, and Natural Order abilities.", "scepter_loc": "Causes Elder Titan to become debuff immune and gain %immunity_resist%%% magic resistance for %scepter_magic_immune_per_hero% seconds per affected enemy Hero when the spirit returns."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Elder Titan sends forth his Astral Spirit, damaging any units it passes through. When the spirit rejoins the Titan, it grants bonus damage and movement speed for each unit it passed through. The Astral Spirit possesses the Echo Stomp, Return Spirit, and Natural Order abilities.", "scepter_loc": "Causes Elder Titan to become debuff immune and gain %immunity_resist%%% magic resistance for %scepter_magic_immune_per_hero% seconds per affected enemy Hero when the spirit returns."}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:elder_titan_ancestral_spirit:aoe_damage:base", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "2a767241f1ea1b41212c", "mechanism": "debuff_immunity", "mechanism_zh": "减益免疫/技能免疫", "definition": "处于减益免疫（技能免疫）时，只有能无视减益免疫的效果才对其生效（如碎颅锤的重击可以眩晕开了黑皇杖的单位）", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "d20578bf07b75a0be924", "mechanism": "haste", "mechanism_zh": "加速", "definition": "提升自身、自己的单位或友方的移动速度（顺带加一点移速的也算）；只让敌人变慢的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "elder_titan_echo_stomp", "name_zh": "上古巨神·回音重踏", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "CHANNELED - Elder Titan and his Astral Spirit both stomp the ground, damaging and knocking nearby enemy units unconscious around their locations. The Elder Titan stomp deals physical damage, while the Spirit stomp deals magical damage.", "notes_loc": ["If a unit is hit by Astral Spirit and Elder Titan, they will take both instances of damage."], "shard_loc": "Lowers Cooldown. Echo Stomp may be placed on alt-cast to allow Elder Titan to take the place of the Astral Spirit as it completes its stomp."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "CHANNELED - Elder